{"CanContainContent": false, "Category": "Marigold", "CreatedBy": "Muse", "Description": "One-click content builder for the MARIGOLD UE5 RTX tech demo (Chapter 1: Ofrenda Night). Imports staged models/audio, builds art-bible materials, constructs the OfrendaNight map, wires 25 candle lights, and configures Lumen/MegaLights/DLSS render settings. All designs original, on authentic Dia de Muertos tradition.", "EngineVersion": "5.7.0", "FileVersion": 3, "FriendlyName": "MarigoldBuilder", "Installed": false, "IsBetaVersion": false, "IsExperimentalVersion": false, "Modules": [{"LoadingPhase": "PostEngineInit", "Name": "MarigoldBuilder", "Type": "Editor"}], "Plugins": [{"Enabled": true, "Name": "ProceduralMeshComponent"}, {"Enabled": true, "Name": "MarigoldFX"}, {"Enabled": true, "Name": "MarigoldPreFlight"}], "Version": 1, "VersionName": "1.0.0"}